#: data/maps/LavaridgeTown_HerbShop/scripts.inc:46
msgctxt "LavaridgeTown_HerbShop_Text_YouveComeToLookAtHerbalMedicine"
msgid ""
"You've come to look at herbal medicine\n"
"in LAVARIDGE?\p"
