"for making herbal medicine.\p"
"It also does wonders when held by\n"
"a POKéMON.\p"
"It intensifies the power of FIRE-type\n"
"moves.$"
msgstr ""

#: data/maps/LavaridgeTown_HerbShop/scripts.inc:60
msgctxt "LavaridgeTown_HerbShop_Text_HerbalMedicineWorksButMonWillDislike"
msgid ""
"Herbal medicine works impressively well.\n"
"But your POKéMON will dislike you for it.\l"
"It must be horribly bitter!$"
